169
00:06:22,970 --> 00:06:24,440
the same corner to the same

170
00:06:24,470 --> 00:06:25,190
height, and rescan.

171
00:06:33,910 --> 00:06:35,380
With just the strut tower brace,

172
00:06:35,410 --> 00:06:37,630
the engine bay is 0.8 millimeters

173
00:06:37,660 --> 00:06:38,630
wider than our control.

174
00:06:38,660 --> 00:06:40,130
That's about half of what it

175
00:06:40,160 --> 00:06:41,130
was with no bracing.

176
00:06:41,160 --> 00:06:42,130
So it's doing something.

177
00:06:42,160 --> 00:06:43,380
But here's the interesting part.

178
00:06:43,410 --> 00:06:44,880
This brace bolts right to the

179
00:06:44,910 --> 00:06:46,380
strut towers, and by this measurement

180
00:06:46,410 --> 00:06:47,880
the fender braces were more effective.

181
00:06:48,760 --> 00:06:51,260
0.8 for the strut tower brace.

182
00:06:51,290 --> 00:06:53,510
0.3 for the fender braces.

183
00:06:54,390 --> 00:06:55,980
Now look at the heat map.

184
00:06:56,010 --> 00:06:57,340
No bracing on the left,

185
00:06:57,370 --> 00:06:58,960
